{"version":1,"content":"\n<p>MCBackup Pro 是一款針對 iPhone 與 iPad 的通訊錄備份及轉移工具，適合更換裝置、整理重複聯絡人或希望離線保存電話簿的用戶。原價 US $0.99，現正<a href=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/category/apps-%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/%E9%99%90%E6%99%82%E5%85%8D%E8%B2%BB%E6%83%85%E5%A0%B1/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">限時免費</a>。</p>\n<figure><img alt=\"限時免費\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"460\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/460x460Icon-Ap-SiOS01-75-53.webp\" width=\"460\"/></figure>\n<h2>一鍵備份還原通訊錄</h2>\n<p>MCBackup Pro 可一鍵將聯絡人備份為 VCF 或 CSV 檔案，並透過電郵或雲端儲存保存；需要時可從檔案快速還原。內置重複聯絡人合併與刪除工具，亦支援選擇性匯入、分享及轉移通訊錄。全程在本機完成，無須伺服器、帳戶或電腦，兼顧整理效率與私隱。</p>\n<figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-67-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-68-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-69-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-70-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-71-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure><figure><img alt=\"App Screenshot\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"2560\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/1320x2868bb-72-scaled.jpg\" width=\"1178\"/></figure></figure>\n<ul><li>應用名稱：MCBackup Pro – Contacts Backup</li><li>應用類別：Productivity</li><li>下載位置：<a href=\"https://apps.apple.com/app/mcbackup-pro-contacts-backup/id1406717706?uo=4\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">App Store</a></li></ul>\n","scraped_at":"2026-11-03T16:01:24.433889+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":300,"images":7,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-03T15:49:56+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-04T01:58:24.022315+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-03T15:58:40.849854+00:00","content_hash":"87ba04f747027fb72bdbe34cd070d6666ad7783e3f7a4d440ee50a7ed6745663","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-03T16:01:24.433889+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}